-- 2026-10-12 (merge of the friend's Westfall..Wailing Caverns build): re-run on purpose. His changed 000/006/007/027/032 run again, and without this line they would undo the fixes in this file. Same content as before, safe to run twice.
-- mod-turtle-content: caster mana fix (Max + Claude, 2026-10-11)
-- The converter gives these casters unit_class 1 (warrior) = 0 mana in 3.3.5, so their
-- mana-cost spells silently fail. This switches them to unit_class 2 (paladin = has mana)
-- and scales Health/Damage/Armor modifiers so HP, damage and armor stay as before.
-- Safe to run again: a row only changes while it still has the converter's values
-- (class 1 + original HealthModifier). If the converter gets fixed, the row is skipped.
-- Rollback: the original values are in the comment at the end of each line.

